characters.source:
Assistant Characters (AI-controlled):
```json
{{#if characters.length}}[
{{#each characters}}  {
    "name": {{{jsonValue name}}}{{#if (ne nickname undefined)}},
    "nickname": {{{jsonValue nickname}}}{{/if}}{{#if (ne description undefined)}},
    "description": {{{jsonValue description}}}{{/if}}{{#if (ne personality undefined)}},
    "personality": {{{jsonValue personality}}}{{/if}}{{#if (ne this.[extra lore] undefined)}},
    "extra lore": {{{jsonValue this.[extra lore] 4}}}{{/if}}
  }{{#unless @last}},{{/unless}}
{{/each}}]{{else}}[]{{/if}}
```

personas.source:
User Characters (player-controlled):
```json
{{#if personas.length}}[
{{#each personas}}  {
    "name": {{{jsonValue name}}}{{#if (ne description undefined)}},
    "description": {{{jsonValue description}}}{{/if}}
  }{{#unless @last}},{{/unless}}
{{/each}}]{{else}}[]{{/if}}
```

